  "title": "Quenched Cheesy Algerian Almond Tagine",
  "description": "A malty, cheese-pulled Algerian tagine that combines tender chicken, toasted almonds, and a touch of date syrup for a nostalgic flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
