      "amount": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a tagine or heavy pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Stir in the minced garlic and spice blend, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Place the chicken thighs in the pot and brown on all sides.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and drizzle the date syrup over the meat.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 30 minutes until the chicken is tender.",
    "Add the toasted almonds and shredded cheese, stirring gently until the cheese melts.",
    "Finish with lemon zest, salt, and pepper, then serve hot over couscous or bread."
  ],
